        <div class="drivers">F7 at 72% places dissolution as the base-case outcome before October 27. The coalition sits at 60 seats below the 61-seat majority threshold; the Knesset legal adviser recommended July 17 dissolution; the Edelstein-Shaked rival alliance is active. Netanyahu's historical resilience in electoral crises is the primary downward bound on the range.</div>
